{{Quote|Coral reefs tall as the sky and sharp as knives! I would show you all, but I fear it is not what I remember. It's been too long since I returned, and I think I never will; I do not wonder what the Empire has done to Tibrin.|[[Sata Neek]]|<ref name="Alphabet Squadron" />}}
'''Tibrin''' was an [[Water|aquatic]] [[planet]] covered in phosphorescent seas with towering [[coral]] reefs as tall as the sky. It was located in the [[Tibrin system]], a [[trinary star system]] on the edge of the [[Hadar sector]] in the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]. It was the [[homeworld]] of the [[Ishi Tib]] [[species]].

==History==
{{Quote|Well, that sure complicates things, Commander.''"<br />"''No worse than that time on Tibrin.''"<br />"''We had Jedi with us on Tibrin. They ''helped''.|Captain Rex and Commander Cody|<ref name="Rookies" />}}
During the [[High Republic Era]], [[Captain]] [[Hedda Casset]] and the crew of the ''[[Legacy Run]]'' were tasked with taking a [[saberfish]], which had been taken from the storm [[Ocean|seas]] of Tibrin, to an [[Abregado-rae]] [[Unidentified countess|countess]]. Three cycles later, the crew of the ''Legacy Run'' needed to return the creature to Tibrin after the countess's staff were unable to properly take care of it.<ref name="Light of the Jedi" />

During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Clone Captain]] [[Rex]], [[Clone Commander]] [[Cody]], and [[Jedi|members]] of the [[Jedi Order]] were involved in a situation on Tibrin.<ref name="Rookies">{{TCW|Rookies (episode)}}</ref>

Some [[time]] after the [[Battle of Yavin]], the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]], which was in dire need of support from the [[Ishi Tib]]s, [[Mission to Tibrin|sent]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] to Tibrin under the guise as the representative of [[House Berenko]] of [[Naboo]]. [[Gender|She]] was accompanied by the [[Jedi]] [[Luke Skywalker]] and two [[pilot]]s named [[Jaahn Liddle]] and [[Tadd Marteens|Tadd]].<ref name="Trouble at Tibrin" />

